					<h4>Admission Criteria for International Students</h4>
					<p>While each university has its specific requirements, most Australian universities require:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><b>Academic Records:</b> Transcripts equivalent to Australian Year 12 or an international qualification such as the IB. </li>
						<li><b>English Proficiency:</b> A minimum score of 6.5 in IELTS or equivalent in TOEFL/PTE. </li>
						<li><b>Statement of Purpose (SOP)</b> and references. </li>
						<li><b>Visa Requirements:</b> Subclass 500 Student Visa is necessary for all international students.</li>
